From jmacdon at uw.edu  Tue Sep 25 16:21:08 2012
From: jmacdon at uw.edu (James W. MacDonald)
Date: Tue, 25 Sep 2012 10:21:08 -0400
Subject: [BioC] Affymetrix data double normalisation
